          "quoteEnd": 23,
          "quote": "子曰：“道不远人，人之为道而远人，不可以为道。"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "rysxguji-liji-29-13",
          "textHash": "0b121c5b780e3aa89c0bbfdc46a52b680eee1aac07fcb1f0a3d64f8cbd0a5e41",
          "quoteStart": 23,
          "quoteEnd": 38,
          "quote": "诗云：‘伐柯伐柯，其则不远。’"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "rysxguji-liji-29-13",
          "textHash": "0b121c5b780e3aa89c0bbfdc46a52b680eee1aac07fcb1f0a3d64f8cbd0a5e41",
          "quoteStart": 38,
          "quoteEnd": 54,
          "quote": "执柯以伐柯，睨而视之，犹以为远。"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "rysxguji-liji-29-13",
          "textHash": "0b121c5b780e3aa89c0bbfdc46a52b680eee1aac07fcb1f0a3d64f8cbd0a5e41",
          "quoteStart": 54,
          "quoteEnd": 66,
          "quote": "故君子以人治人，改而止。"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "rysxguji-liji-29-13",
          "textHash": "0b121c5b780e3aa89c0bbfdc46a52b680eee1aac07fcb1f0a3d64f8cbd0a5e41",
          "quoteStart": 66,
          "quoteEnd": 86,
          "quote": "忠恕违道不远，施诸己而不愿，亦勿施于人。"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "rysxguji-liji-29-13",
          "textHash": "0b121c5b780e3aa89c0bbfdc46a52b680eee1aac07fcb1f0a3d64f8cbd0a5e41",
          "quoteStart": 86,
          "quoteEnd": 147,
          "quote": "君子之道四，丘未能一焉：所求乎子以事父，未能也；所求乎臣以事君，未能也；所求乎弟以事兄，未能也；所求乎朋友先施之，未能也。"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "rysxguji-liji-29-13",
          "textHash": "0b121c5b780e3aa89c0bbfdc46a52b680eee1aac07fcb1f0a3d64f8cbd0a5e41",
          "quoteStart": 147,
          "quoteEnd": 167,
          "quote": "庸德之行，庸言之谨，有所不足，不敢不勉。"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "rysxguji-liji-29-13",
          "textHash": "0b121c5b780e3aa89c0bbfdc46a52b680eee1aac07fcb1f0a3d64f8cbd0a5e41",
          "quoteStart": 167,
          "quoteEnd": 190,
          "quote": "有余，不敢尽，言顾行，行顾言，君子胡不慥慥尔。"
        }
      ],
