      ],
      "proposals": [
        {
          "sourceId": "rysxguji-lunyu-7-26",
          "textHash": "1600aeb54c78544c6d0ef74e7f3254ae110101ed23493477541a4caac9412014",
          "quoteStart": 0,
          "quoteEnd": 18,
          "quote": "子曰：“盖有不知而作之者，我无是也。"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "rysxguji-lunyu-7-26",
          "textHash": "1600aeb54c78544c6d0ef74e7f3254ae110101ed23493477541a4caac9412014",
          "quoteStart": 18,
          "quoteEnd": 28,
          "quote": "多闻，择其善者而从之"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "rysxguji-lunyu-7-26",
          "textHash": "1600aeb54c78544c6d0ef74e7f3254ae110101ed23493477541a4caac9412014",
          "quoteStart": 18,
          "quoteEnd": 40,
          "quote": "多闻，择其善者而从之；多见而识之；知之次也。"
        }
      ],
      "calls": [],
